schema: claim-evidence
object:
  title: Ethereum Foundation ESP explicitly supports community events and hubs
  type: claim-evidence
  claim: >-
    "The Ethereum Foundation Ecosystem Support Program explicitly supports
    community events and has run requests for proposals to establish
    permanent community hubs."
  evidence: >-
    Cited to esp.ethereum.foundation in the article's References list.
  source_lineage: "src/content/docs/funding-gatherings.md, References: https://esp.ethereum.foundation/"
  interpretation: >-
    Consistent with ESP's known public-goods/ecosystem-grant remit; the
    specific claim about "requests for proposals to establish permanent
    community hubs" is a program-history detail that changes over time as ESP
    runs new RFPs.
  uncertainty: >-
    Program specifics (whether a community-hub RFP is currently open,
    funding amounts, deadlines) are time-sensitive and were not independently
    verified against the live ESP site at ingestion time; check
    esp.ethereum.foundation directly before advising a node to apply.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/funding-gatherings.md
    transformation: summarized
    authorship: ai-assisted
